	// EVERY KEY IS CHECKED NOW, AND THE JOB CARRIES THAT LIST. The corner is read 200 keys at a
	// time and each page is checked before the job exists (decision 0951). A permission taken away
	// afterwards does not take a key out. An armed reveal freeze, your suspension or your leaving
	// stops the job before its next batch, and nothing lands. Name `key_ring_id` to take out one key
	// group of the corner.
	//
	// THE PASSWORD IS HELD IN MEMORY ONLY, by the process running the job, and never written. It
	// is dropped once the file is written. A job whose process dies fails, because nothing else
	// holds the password, and you start again.
	//
	// WRITE-ONLY VALUES ARE IN NO EXPORT. A privileged key goes in only with an approved ask or an
	// open check-out of yours; otherwise it is left out with a refused look on it, and counted.
	//
	// ONE CHECK'S WORTH IS REFUSED (`key_export_fits_one_check`): an archive one permission check
	// covers is locked on your device, so its password never leaves the device. Use `exportKeys`.
	// NOTHING HERE YOU MAY EXPORT is refused (`key_export_nothing_to_export`), and no job starts.
	//
	// A SESSION ON A WIPED DEVICE TAKES NOTHING OUT — `device_wiped`. ONE PASSKEY PROOF COVERS THE
	// RUN — `passkey_proof_required`. Each value read is still one line in the key's History.
	//
	// A SIGNATURE, WHERE THE COMPANY'S KEY RULES ASK FOR ONE, for the company's corner. Name the
