	// GetKeysAutofillSettings Your own Autofill settings that Keys holds
	//
	// THE TWO AUTOFILL SETTINGS A FILL OBEYS (ONPLO-4896), from Keys app → Settings → Autofill &
	// browser extension: the key groups autofill may use, and the sites it never fills. A setting
	// you never chose answers where it starts: every key group, and no site.
	//
	// THE PAGE'S OTHER SETTINGS ARE NOT HERE. Fill on click only, offering to save, one-time codes,
	// passkeys and the offline copy are each held with the client that obeys them. Asking before a
	// new address waits on a key holding more than one (ONPLO-4898), and whether agents may ask to
	// fill on an agent's fill (ONPLO-4734).
