	// capital letter or a spelled-out 443 is the same site, and is answered that way.
	//
	// A LIST SENT WITH THE SAME ID OR SITE TWICE, or a key group list with `every_key_ring: true`, is
	// refused with 422 naming the field. Nothing is written.
	//
	// NOT GATED, and yours alone: it changes nobody else's settings and no other account
	// environment's. Only a person has Autofill settings: an agent or a machine is refused with
	// 403 `ring_requires_person`.
	//
	// Takes any type of body and a specified content type.
