	// the key.
	//
	// ANSWERED ONCE — `check_out_already_answered`. The same answer sent again by the same
	// person changes nothing and answers the check-out as it stands; another answer is refused.
	//
	// APPROVE CHECKS THE ASKER IS STILL HERE. "An ask whose asker is no longer a member of the
	// company cannot be approved, even when news of their leaving has not reached Keys yet.
	// Approve then withdraws the ask as above, and the approver sees why." So an approval of a
