//
// THE ARCHIVE IS KDBX 4, opened with a password you set here and Onplo never stores. THE CSV
// has the columns `name`, `url`, `username`, `password`, `notes` and `totp`, and is answered
// here and never lands in Storage (the spec lane's ruling of 2 November 2026, ONPLO-1656). A key
// holds no username, notes or one-time code yet, so both files leave those empty.
//
// WRITE-ONLY VALUES ARE IN NO EXPORT, because nothing can read them. The answer counts the
