	// `environment_entry_has_its_own_operation` (decision 0831).
	//
	// BOTH ARE ASKED, IN ONE QUESTION (decision 0632, rule 6): Keys' `keys:key.change` of the key,
	// and Flows' `flows:environment-secret.change` of the deploy environment in the path.
	//
