	// ListKeyHealthFindingsWithResponse The keys of one Key health group, each with its finding
	//
	// "A ROW IS THE KEY PLUS THE FINDING IN ONE SENTENCE" — the key, what was found, and the date or
	// address it was found on. A page at a time, the keys you may see, in the order of their names.
