	// ListKeyRingsWithResponse The key groups you hold
	//
	// NOT GATED, because the catalogue gates no read on a key group: making, changing, deleting and
	// sharing one are permissions, and seeing the key groups you already reach is not. It answers the
	// key groups you hold a grant on and no other — a key group you cannot reach is absent, so the list
	// never tells you a key group exists that you may not open.
	//
	// A NEW ACCOUNT ENVIRONMENT ALREADY HAS ONE: the default key group, so a first key lands somewhere
	// without a decision. Nobody named it, so it carries no `name` until somebody does.
	//
	// Returns a wrapper object for the known response body format(s).
