	// own. It answers in the account environment this credential acts in and never beyond it: a
	// key belongs to one environment and switching environment switches the whole list.
	//
	// ONLY WHAT YOU MAY SEE. Access is granted per key group and reaches nothing otherwise, so a key in
	// a key group you hold no grant on is not in this list — absent, never masked.
	//
	// NO VALUE, ON ANY ROW, FOR ANYBODY. Seeing a key is `keys:key.read`; seeing its value is
	// `keys:key-value.read` and its own operation.
