	// `key_in_trash`): restore it first. A write-only key is shared like any other and still shows
	// its value to nobody. A privileged key is shared like any other and every use still asks.
	//
	// SHARING AGAIN CHANGES THE SHARE THAT IS THERE. A holder has one grant per object (decision
