// ListGuestShareAsksWithResponse The guest shares waiting for your signature
//
// THE GUEST SHARES UNDER PENDING ASKS: "who wants to share, which key or key group, with whom, in
// which role and until when" (decision 0776, point 3). Each is an ask `waiting`, the longest
// waiting first, by when it was asked. One that was answered, or whose "Access until" has
// passed, leaves this list: it has `ended`, "because there is nothing left to give".
//
// WHO MAY SEE THEM: whoever holds Approve somebody else's ask on a guest share
// (`keys:guest-share.approve`), which is given across the account environment, so the door
// asks it before anything is read. A Business environment only: a personal environment shares
// with no outside person through an ask.
//
// AN ASK OF YOUR OWN IS LISTED TOO, where you hold the permission, and is never yours to
// answer: `answerGuestShareAsk` refuses it.
//
// A PAGE SERVED IS ONE LOOK, an empty one too, and it names no ask.
//
