// THE SAME LIST SEEN FROM THE OTHER SIDE. Each row is one person who named you, with the
// account environment the row was made in, what you may reach one day, how long you must
// wait after asking, and where a request stands.
//
// NOT GATED. "Asking needs no permission, and neither does seeing who named you. Being named
// is what lets a person ask, and no role can give or withhold it."
