// THE ROWS THAT NAME YOU AND NO OTHER. A row that names somebody else is absent, so the list
// never tells you who else a person trusts, or that they trust anybody.
//
// A ROW THAT ENDED IS NOT HERE. Once your access to a company has ended, your list "drops
// every row belonging to that company", so a row that reads `left` on the other side is
// absent from this one.
