// that names you, "whichever account environment it was made in", so a person named in a
// company they cannot enter has a place to look. IN A BUSINESS ENVIRONMENT: "the rows made
// in that environment and no others". It is the same row in both places, under the same id,
// and `environment_id` says where it was made.
