//   - "You are told on every day of the waiting period, and one click denies it" — the person
//     who named you, with `denyEmergencyAccess`. Once when you ask, then every 24 hours from it,
//     under `keys.emergency-countdown-running`, "waiting on you", naming you and when the wait
